Generated by scripts/domain.sh (docs/domain.md): active.conf = HTTPS vhost of the
current domain + the 301 vhost of the old one during the transition. Mounted in
nginx at /etc/nginx/domain. Never edit by hand.
realip.conf = Cloudflare's ranges for CF-Connecting-IP (access mode, docs/access-mode.md); the PROXY-protocol
listeners for a tunnel are appended to active.conf when switched on.
